"<div>\n<i class=\"NoteType\">\nCitation\n</i>\n<div class=\"grampsstylednote\">\n<p>\nSource Citation<br />\nLibrary and Archives Canada; Ottawa, ON, Canada; Passenger Lists, 1865-1935; Series: RG 76-C; Roll: C-4538\n</p>\n<p>\nDescription<br />\nMonth: 11\n</p>\n<p>\nSource Information<br />\nAncestry.com. Canada, Incoming Passenger Lists, 1865-1935 [database on-line]. Lehi, UT, USA: Ancestry.com Operations Inc, 2010.<br />\nOriginal data:Passenger Lists, 1865\u20131935. Microfilm Publications T-479 to T-520, T-4689 to T-4874, T-14700 to T-14938, C-4511 to C-4542. Library and Archives Canada, n.d. RG 76-C. Department of Employment and Immigration fonds. Library and Archives Canada Ottawa, Ontario, Canada.\n</p>\n<p>\nSource Description<br />\nPassenger lists of ships arriving in various Canadian ports as well as some eastern U.S. ports from 1865\u20131935 are indexed this database. These lists served as the immigration records for Canada between these years and information that is included are surname, age, gender, marital status, destination, occupation, birth country, etc.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
