"<div>\n<i class=\"NoteType\">\nCitation\n</i>\n<div class=\"grampsstylednote\">\n<p>\nNote by user:<br />\n\"This picture was in my father\u2019s letters from Cousin Dorthy Mae Trowbridge Lee Dunlap.   It is the only photo we have of our great, great Grandmother Mary Effie Ashcraft Beals Dunlap.  She was married twice.  First Husband was John Abraham Beals and her second husband was Henry Dill Dunlap.  She died in Child birth having Mary Evalina Dunlap born March 15th, 1887, Annin Ca, Pennsylvania. \"\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
