"<div>\n<i class=\"NoteType\">\nCitation\n</i>\n<div class=\"grampsstylednote\">\n<p>\nSource Citation<br />\nPresbyterian Historical Society; Philadelphia, PA, USA; US, Presbyterian Church Records, 1701-1907; Book Title: Session Minutes and Register 1927-1955; Accession Number: V Mi46 W852fs\n</p>\n<p>\nDescription<br />\nYear: 1926-1970\n</p>\n<p>\nSource Information<br />\nAncestry.com. U.S., Presbyterian Church Records, 1701-1970 [database on-line]. Lehi, UT, USA: Ancestry.com Operations, Inc., 2016.<br />\nOriginal data:Church Registers. Presbyterian Historical Society, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania.\n</p>\n<p>\nSource Description<br />\nThis collection contains records from Presbyterian churches in the United States from 1701 to 1970. Records collected by American missionaries in Lebanon are also included. The collection consists of records of baptism, marriage, death, burial, and church membership.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
